{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 15, :comments ["<b>למס עובד</b> Three times in the Masorah: here, and the others in Joshua אשר לא הוריש וגו' ויתנם למס עובד, and ויעלה שלמה למס עובד. To teach: not enough that he taught Torah to all Israel, but that he raised for them tribute from his wealth, which sufficed for all who came to study."], :book :genesis, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 49, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Kitzur Baal HaTurim" "http://sefaria.org"] ["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:18:42.402529841Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}